# Keys of the niri feel (feels/niri.lua), shown first in the Keybinds cheat sheet while it's active.
# Every other key is the same as in the Hyprland feel (binds.lua). Format: KEYS | description.

SUPER + ← / →                   | Focus the column left / right (at the end: the monitor that way)
SUPER + ↑ / ↓                   | Focus the window above / below in the column
SUPER + SHIFT + ← / →           | Move the column left / right (at the end: onto an empty monitor)
SUPER + SHIFT + ↑ / ↓           | Move the window up / down in its column
SUPER + CTRL + ← / →            | Column narrower / wider
SUPER + CTRL + ↑ / ↓            | Window shorter / taller in its column
Top-left screen corner          | Overview
3 fingers ← / →                 | Scroll the strip of columns
3 fingers ↑ / ↓                 | Workspace above / below
4 fingers ↑ / ↓                 | Overview
